      "statusChangeID": "5cf004174883af3434314b93",
      "statusChangeNewStatus": "in progress",
      "value": "We have a partial fix for this in the upcoming VRChat release. It should up the number of audio sources able to play at once from 24 to 63. Passed 63 sources playing at once, individual audio sources will stop working as you see now. The next (and full fix) is to make sure the higher priority audio sources (probably world audio) does not break due to lower priority audio.",
